{{!-- A diagonal banner across the card's top-right corner. Flair, for a card
      that has earned a stamp -- an MVP, a critical, a first blood.

      Sits outside the card's flow and clips itself against its own corner box, so
      it needs nothing from the card but a positioning context. Order in the parts
      list does not matter; put it first so a reader of the composition meets it
      where it appears. --}}
<div class="cpb-part-ribbon{{#if tone}} cpb-tone-{{tone}}{{/if}}">
    <span class="cpb-part-ribbon-text">{{text}}</span>
</div>
